   "body_first_400": "Updated the catalog pin from `v0.1.0` to `v0.1.1` (`ead68009b0bb0f27a0b0f397d32181d35333fb92`).\n\nThe new release fixes a Responses API compatibility issue: the original middleware sanitized every string under `input`, which could replace protocol item IDs with bracketed PII aliases and trigger HTTP 400 malformed-ID errors. `v0.1.1` preserves IDs and other protocol metadata while sanitizing model-v"
